Answers the 2020-thread 'preset option packages' direction with the
smallest honest surface: AMs composing heap-standard options with their
own keys call heap_reloptions_for_am(am_keys) instead of hand-stripping
(what the test module previously demonstrated inline). Richer custom
layouts remain the build_reloptions pattern (index-AM style).
Test module now exercises the helper; suite green.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
